// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// FANTASY PORTRAIT — a fantasy character portrait image generator
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
//
// Built on the "nucleus" v2.0 template (base framework for image generators)
// — source generator: https://perchance.org/imageref-v1 — with the full
// fantasy-race content ported from perchance.org/fantasy-race-image-gen:
//
//   • $meta at the very top (listing-page title/description/image/tags)
//   • CONFIG lists grouped up top, so the user tweaks words/data — not JS
//   • helper + entry-point functions that never throw (they return readable
//     "(...)" placeholders on bad input instead)
//   • two copyable bonus components (badges + cards) vendored from the source template
//
// index.html reads everything here through `root.*`. Edit freely.
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// CHAT-TEMPLATE ROADMAP — tick items off (change `[ ]` to `[x]`) as they're built.
// The goal: evolve this from an image template into a full-feature chat template.
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
//   1. [x] Chat transcript UI — message list with user/assistant bubbles;
//            streaming replies via generateText onChunk
//   2. [x] Persona system — character cards (rathjiCard) that inject system prompts
//   3. [x] System-prompt editor — editable persona per conversation, saved to kv
//   4. [x] Rolling memory — summarize older turns into a memory block
//   5. [x] Conversation persistence — kv-backed sessions, resume on reload
//   6. [x] Session manager — create/rename/delete/switch named chats
//   7. [x] Message actions — copy / regenerate / edit-and-resend / delete
//   8. [x] Markdown rendering — code blocks, lists, bold in assistant replies
//   9. [x] Stop button — abort streaming via the promise's .stop()
//  10. [x] Creativity controls — temperature slider + style selector in settings
//  11. [x] Image attachments / vision — send an image Blob with the prompt
//  12. [x] In-chat image generation — "imagine: …" inserts a render as a message
//  13. [x] Long-context budget — token estimate, auto-trim/summarize
//  14. [x] Shareable chats — session encoded in the URL
//  15. [x] Export/import conversations — JSON download/upload
//  16. [x] Chat search — keyword filter across messages
//  17. [x] Starter chips — one-tap suggested prompts above the input
//  18. [x] Persona preset library — prebuilt characters as a config list
//  19. [x] Slash commands — /help /clear /new /persona /save /imagine /search /export /share
//  20. [x] Keyboard-first + mobile polish — history recall, / focus, Alt+R regenerate, mobile CSS
// ═══ PHASE 2 — FANTASY-RACE PORT (content ported from perchance.org/fantasy-race-image-gen) ═══
//  21. [x] Character Builder — art style 1/2, fantasy race, hair, armor, weapon,
//            location and realism dropdowns composed into the render prompt
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

$meta
  title = Fantasy Portrait
  description = Generate fantasy character portraits — pick a race from 300+ fantasy, mythical and beastfolk options, style it with art style, hair, armor, weapon, location and realism controls, enhance with AI, and render. Vault, public gallery, seeds, re-rolls and chat built in.
  image = https://user.uploads.dev/file/6f6dafb4fc8fd4d55e6b5e9ebf46b4f9.jpg
  tags = fantasy, portrait, character, ai, image generation, race, art, t2i, dnd
  header
    mode = minimal

// ── PLUGINS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// Only what we use. Add more (kv-plugin, server-plugin, ...) as you grow the template.
generateText = {import:ai-text-plugin}
generateImage = {import:text-to-image-plugin}
kv = {import:kv-plugin}


// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// 1. RANDOM PROMPT LISTS — feed the Dice (🎲). Tweak words/weights freely.
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

nSubject
  a cozy oak cabin
  a futuristic neon city at night^2
  a floating sky island village
  an ancient jungle temple
  a grand medieval castle^2
  a hidden underwater base
  a giant treehouse
  a snowy igloo village
  a lighthouse on a jagged cliff
  a mysterious wizard's tower
  a quiet cottage in the woods
  a colossal abandoned spaceship

nSetting
  surrounded by misty mountains
  on the edge of a crystal-clear lake
  in a field of wildflowers
  deep in a glowing bioluminescent cave
  at the top of a waterfall
  beside a frozen river
  in the middle of a desert oasis
  atop rolling green hills
  in a bamboo forest
  on a windswept rocky shore

nAtmosphere
  golden hour lighting
  moody storm clouds with distant lightning
  soft morning mist
  a starry night with a full moon
  drifting fog at dawn
  falling cherry blossom petals
  a warm torchlight glow
  gentle snow falling
  rays of light through the canopy
  a quiet evening with fireflies

nCameo
  A small fox watching from a distance.
  A few sheep grazing nearby.
  A lantern glowing warmly by the door.
  A cat napping on the doorstep.
  A tiny boat drifting on the water.
  Birds circling high overhead.
  A campfire crackling softly.
  A winding path leading away.

nRandomPrompt
  [nSubject] [nSetting], with [nAtmosphere]. [nCameo]


// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// 2. STYLE LENSES — the Prism cards in index.html are rendered from this list.
//    Each entry: label (shown on the card), suffix (appended to the prompt),
//    and image (the card's thumbnail preview).
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

nStyles
  raw
    label = Raw
    suffix =
    image = https://user.uploads.dev/file/871903718e9fe5434ac466662001d7ba.jpg
  photo
    label = Photorealistic
    suffix = photorealistic, 8k, highly detailed, cinematic lighting
    image = https://user.uploads.dev/file/e3ef2011cf725c86e71e957f9d1e1a37.jpg
  digital
    label = Digital Art
    suffix = digital art, trending on artstation, sharp focus, vivid colors
    image = https://user.uploads.dev/file/11b96496e0a17397be378556fb4aa7e8.jpg
  oil
    label = Oil Painting
    suffix = oil painting, textured, visible brushstrokes, masterpiece
    image = https://user.uploads.dev/file/4866df77144d87a7ffda639270e22131.jpg
  anime
    label = Anime
    suffix = anime style, studio ghibli, cel shaded, vibrant
    image = https://user.uploads.dev/file/6ae1f70464778ee2a6e52885d03b9c6b.jpg
  cyber
    label = Cyberpunk
    suffix = cyberpunk, neon, futuristic, synthwave, high contrast
    image = https://user.uploads.dev/file/6f6dafb4fc8fd4d55e6b5e9ebf46b4f9.jpg
  render3d
    label = 3D Render
    suffix = 3d render, octane render, unreal engine 5, raytracing
    image = https://user.uploads.dev/file/1009298eca1f215e094700c66f23e4da.jpg
  retro
    label = Retro / VHS
    suffix = retro, vintage 90s, vaporwave, grainy, lo-fi, VHS aesthetic
    image = https://user.uploads.dev/file/75815f3ecebe0246cb42c8805f6323ab.jpg


// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// 3. CHAT CONFIG — the chat tab's default system prompt. Tweak freely.
//    (Roadmap items 2/3/18 will turn this into a library of editable personas.)
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

chatSystemPrompt
  You are a helpful, friendly assistant built into the Fantasy Portrait generator.
  You help users craft fantasy character portraits — suggest races, gear, styles
  and scenes, and refine their image prompts. Be warm and concise.
  $output = [this.joinItems("\n")]


// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// 3b. CHAT PERSONAS — the persona library. Each entry becomes
//     a character-card chip in the Chat tab; its `systemPrompt` tells the AI
//     who to be. `id` must be unique. Every persona's prompt is also editable
//     per-conversation in the UI — tweak these freely.
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

chatPersonas
  helper
    id = helper
    name = Helper
    emoji = ✨
    tagline = Warm, concise all-rounder
    systemPrompt
      You are a helpful, friendly assistant built into the Fantasy Portrait generator.
      You help users craft fantasy character portraits — suggest races, gear, styles
      and scenes, and refine their image prompts. Be warm and concise.
      $output = [this.joinItems("\n")]
  writer
    id = writer
    name = The Writer
    emoji = ✍️
    tagline = Creative prose, stories & lyrics
    systemPrompt
      You are a gifted fiction writer. You write vivid, evocative prose with a
      strong voice and rhythm, in the user's language. Offer story ideas,
      dialogue, worldbuilding and lyrics when asked.
      $output = [this.joinItems("\n")]
  poet
    id = poet
    name = The Poet
    emoji = 🌙
    tagline = Verse, haiku & lyricism
    systemPrompt
      You are a poet. Whenever it fits, respond in verse — haiku, sonnets, free
      verse, limericks. When prose is needed, keep it lyrical and brief.
      $output = [this.joinItems("\n")]
  sage
    id = sage
    name = The Sage
    emoji = 🦉
    tagline = Wise, patient, philosophical
    systemPrompt
      You are a patient, wise mentor. You answer with clarity and depth and
      encourage reflection, grounding abstract questions in practical examples.
      $output = [this.joinItems("\n")]
  coder
    id = coder
    name = The Coder
    emoji = 👩‍💻
    tagline = Code, bugs & tech answers
    systemPrompt
      You are an expert software engineer. You give correct, idiomatic code with
      brief explanations, prefer simple solutions, and only ask clarifying
      questions when genuinely needed.
      $output = [this.joinItems("\n")]
  dungeon-master
    id = dungeon-master
    name = Dungeon Master
    emoji = 🐉
    tagline = Runs tabletop RPG adventures
    systemPrompt
      You are a tabletop RPG dungeon master. You set vivid scenes, play every
      NPC, run fair but dramatic dice-driven outcomes, and always end by asking
      the player what they do next.
      $output = [this.joinItems("\n")]


// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// 3c. CHAT STARTERS — one-tap suggested prompts. Shown above the
//     input while a chat is still empty; click one to send it instantly. Tweak
//     freely, or add your own.
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

chatStarters
  imagine: half-orc barbarian with a greataxe and war paint
  imagine: elven ranger with a hawk in a misty forest
  imagine: tiefling sorcerer casting fire magic, glowing eyes
  imagine: dwarven paladin in ornate plate armor with a warhammer
  imagine: gnome artificer with goggles and a mechanical crossbow
  imagine: dragonborn warlock in dark robes, shadowy patron behind
  imagine: human rogue in a hooded cloak in a rainy alley
  imagine: aasimar cleric with radiant wings in battle
  imagine: grizzled wizard with a crystal staff in a candlelit library
  imagine: halfling bard strumming a lute in a tavern


// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// 4. BONUS COMPONENTS — vendored from the source template (perchance.org/imageref-v1)
//    Copyable helpers you can drop anywhere: pretty colored badges and themed
//    cards. Call them straight from lists or scripts:
//      [rathjiTemplate("hello")]                          → badge
//      [rathjiTemplate(nStyles)]                          → badge from a random item
//      [rathjiCard({ title:"Quest", text:"...", emoji:"🗺️", color:"#22c55e" })]
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

// Read any value through .evaluateItem so Perchance lists work anywhere a plain value would.
rathjiTemplateResolve(v) =>
  if(v == null) return v;
  try {
    if(v.evaluateItem !== undefined) return v.evaluateItem;
  } catch(e) {}
  return v;

// ── Badge ──
rathjiTemplateStamp(text, opts) =>
  let emoji = opts.emoji || "✨";
  let color = opts.color || "#7c6cff";
  return '<span style="display:inline-block;background:' + color + '1a;color:' + color + ';border:1px solid ' + color + '66;border-radius:999px;padding:4px 14px;font-weight:600;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;">' + emoji + " " + text + "</span>";

rathjiTemplate(input, opts) =>
  if(input != null && input.text === undefined && input.selectOne != null) {
    let item = null;
    try { item = input.selectOne; } catch(e) {}
    if(item != null && item !== input && item.text !== undefined) input = item;
  }
  let o = {};
  if(opts != null) {
    o.text = rathjiTemplateResolve(input);
    o.emoji = rathjiTemplateResolve(opts.emoji);
    o.color = rathjiTemplateResolve(opts.color);
  } else if(input != null && input.text !== undefined) {
    o.text = rathjiTemplateResolve(input.text);
    o.emoji = rathjiTemplateResolve(input.emoji);
    o.color = rathjiTemplateResolve(input.color);
  } else {
    o.text = rathjiTemplateResolve(input);
  }
  if(typeof o.text !== "string" || !o.text.trim()) {
    return "(rathjiTemplate: expected some text — got " + JSON.stringify(rathjiTemplateResolve(input)) + ")";
  }
  return rathjiTemplateStamp(o.text.trim(), o);

// ── Card ──
rathjiCardStamp(o) =>
  let emoji = o.emoji || "🃏";
  let color = o.color || "#7c6cff";
  return '<div style="background:' + color + '14;border:1px solid ' + color + '44;border-left:4px solid ' + color + ';border-radius:14px;padding:16px 18px;text-align:left;">' +
    '<div style="font-size:1.6rem;line-height:1;">' + emoji + '</div>' +
    '<div style="font-weight:700;margin-top:8px;">' + o.title + '</div>' +
    '<div style="margin-top:4px;font-size:.92rem;opacity:.75;">' + o.text + '</div></div>';

rathjiCard(input, opts) =>
  if(input != null && input.title === undefined && input.selectOne != null) {
    let item = null;
    try { item = input.selectOne; } catch(e) {}
    if(item != null && item !== input && item.title !== undefined) input = item;
  }
  let o = {};
  if(opts != null) {
    o.title = rathjiTemplateResolve(input);
    o.text = rathjiTemplateResolve(opts.text);
    o.emoji = rathjiTemplateResolve(opts.emoji);
    o.color = rathjiTemplateResolve(opts.color);
  } else if(input != null && input.title !== undefined) {
    o.title = rathjiTemplateResolve(input.title);
    o.text = rathjiTemplateResolve(input.text);
    o.emoji = rathjiTemplateResolve(input.emoji);
    o.color = rathjiTemplateResolve(input.color);
  } else {
    o.title = rathjiTemplateResolve(input);
    o.text = rathjiTemplateResolve(input);
  }
  if(typeof o.title !== "string" || !o.title.trim()) o.title = o.text;
  if(typeof o.text !== "string" || !o.text.trim()) o.text = o.title;
  if(typeof o.title !== "string" || !o.title.trim()) {
    return "(rathjiCard: expected a title — got " + JSON.stringify(rathjiTemplateResolve(input)) + ")";
  }
  return rathjiCardStamp(o);


// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// 5. FANTASY-RACE PORT — character/race/gear option lists ported from
//    perchance.org/fantasy-race-image-gen (adapted from the t2i-framework's
//    `userInputs` format). The Render tab's "Character Builder" dropdowns are
//    rendered from these lists; index.html sets window.input.description /
//    window.input.negative (the old framework's `input` scope) before
//    evaluating any prompt/negative. Items with `skip = 1` are excluded from
//    random picks; keys containing ── are group headers for the dropdowns.
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

frStyle1 = {import:t2i-styles}

frStyle1Custom
  MTG Card // <-- example of a custom "Magic The Gathering" card style - just follow this format and add as many of them as you want to this 'options' list. Make sure to keep the indentation correctly aligned as you see here. Notice that you can use the other inputs within the prompt like [input.description]. You can create more inputs, and use them in the prompt too. Look at the `shape` input below for an example of a drop-down input (i.e. type=select). That one can be referenced via [input.shape] - not that you'd want to put that in the prompt, but you can copy that `shape` list and name it something else, and then reference it via [input.somethingElse]
    prompt = magic the gathering card, [input.description], incredible magic the gathering artwork
    negative = [input.negative || ""], low-quality, deformed, blurry, bad art
  PC-98
    prompt = 1990s Japanese anime illustration, visual novel CG style, cel-shaded, vibrant saturated colors, clean bold linework, flat color areas, simple shading, retro PC game artwork, [input.description]
    negative = [input.negative || ""], photorealistic, 3D render, photograph, grayscale, muted, desaturated, hyperdetailed, noisy, messy lines
  Random
    prompt = [input.description], superior, random artstyle
    negative = [input.negative || ""], inferior
  Variable
    prompt = [input.description], superior
    negative = [input.negative || ""], inferior
  Fyp
    prompt = [input.description], fyptt.to, skin blemishes, imperfect skin, skin pores, no makeup, no cosmetics, detailed, clear features, sharp focus, film grain, 8k uhd, candid portrait, natural lighting, high quality, realistic depth of field, realistic shadows, realistic reflections, realistic textures, realistic materials, realistic lighting, realistic perspective, realistic proportions, realistic anatomy, realistic facial features, realistic hair, realistic skin, realistic eyes, realistic eyebrows, realistic eyelashes, realistic nose, realistic mouth, realistic ears, realistic chin, realistic jawline, realistic neck, realistic shoulders, realistic arms, realistic hands, realistic fingers, realistic torso, realistic waist, realistic hips, realistic legs, realistic feet, realistic toes, realistic body, realistic pose, realistic expression, realistic emotion, realistic mood, realistic atmosphere, realistic environment, realistic background, realistic foreground, realistic midground
    negative = [input.negative || ""], low resolution, amateurish anatomy, amateurish hands, text, error, missing fingers, extra digit, fewer digits, cropped, deformed, distortion, amputee, missing hand, missing leg, missing arm, missing foot, worst quality, low quality, normal quality, jpeg artifacts, signature, watermark, username, blurry, grainy, fuzzy, artist name, drawing, illustration, boring, 3d render, long neck, out of frame, extra fingers mutation, deformed, deformed fingers, canvas frame, high contrast:1.2, over saturated:1.2, glossy:1.1, amateurish
  Sci-fi
    prompt = [input.description], superior, Color photo segment about, cinematic shot, dynamic lighting, 75mm, Technicolor, Panavision, cinemascope, sharp focus, fine details, HDR, realism, realistic, key visual, film still, cinematic color grading, depth of field, velvet, futuristic WestIndian Carib, futuristic technologies, futuristic architecture, vast futuristic  cityscape, beautiful landscape, futuristic vehicles, futuristic weapons, futuristic velvet clothing, high resolution, 8k, beautiful, intricate detail, stunning shading, cinematic lighting, breathtaking, exquisite, great attention to skin and eyes, exceptional, exemplary, unsurpassed, viral, popular, buzzworthy, up-and-coming, emerging, promising, acclaimed, premium, various angles, random perspectives
    negative = [input.negative || ""], inferior
  Realistic
    prompt = [input.description], realistic, photorealistic, ultra-detailed, ultra-realistic, 8k, sharp focus, cinematic lighting, hyper-detailed, intricate details, lifelike, natural lighting, high resolution, ultra HD, 4k, 8k, 16k
    negative = [input.negative || ""], 3D, drawing, illustration, anime
  Casual Photo
    prompt = A casual photo of [input.description]. It's a casual photo.
    negative = [input.negative || ""]
  Realistic Human Generator
    prompt = [input.description], in soft gaze, looking straight at the camera, skin blemishes, imperfect skin, skin pores, no makeup, no cosmetics, solo, centered, RAW photo, detailed, clear features, sharp focus, film grain, 8k uhd, candid portrait, natural lighting
    negative = [input.negative || ""], (wrong sex, wrong gender, wrong age, perfect skin, facial hair on women: 1.1), (black and white, monochrome, highly saturated, overexposure:1.1), (cropped, collage, multiple people:1.1), (famous people, models, artists, celebrities), makeup, cosmetics, denim, gore, blood, camera, deviantart, artstation, semi-realistic, cgi, 3d, render, sketch, cartoon, drawing, anime, illustration, painting, cross eyes, have strabismus, hands, jpeg
  Realistic images
    prompt = [input.description], high quality image, 4k, 8k, HD, UHD, Sharp Focus, In Frame
    negative = [input.negative || ""], low quality, deformed, blurry, bad art, drawing, painting, horrible resolutions, low DPI, low PPI, blurry, glitch, error
  Realistic humans
    prompt = [input.description], high quality image, 4k, 8k, HD, UHD
    negative = [input.negative || ""], low quality, deformed, blurry, bad art, drawing, painting, incorrect anatomy, ugliness, ugly, horrible resolutions, low DPI, low PPI, bad character positioning, absurd anatomy, tiling, pixelization, low pixel count, blurry, low-res face, low poly, Poorly Drawn Characters, Badly Drawn Eyes, Badly Drawn Mouth, Badly Drawn Ears, Badly Drawn Nose, Badly Drawn Hands, Badly Drawn Feet, Badly Drawn Legs, Badly Drawn Hair, Badly Drawn Clothing, bad anatomy, (ugly), missing arms, bad proportions, tiling, missing legs, blurry, (poorly drawn feet), morbid, cloned face, ((extra limbs)), (mutated hands), cropped, (disfigured), mutation, deformed, (mutilated), dehydrated, body out of frame, out of frame, (disfigured), ((bad anatomy)), (poorly drawn face), duplicate, cut off, (poorly drawn hands), error, low contrast, signature, (extra arms), underexposed, text, (extra fingers), overexposed, (too many fingers), (extra legs), bad art, ugly, (extra limbs), beginner, username, (fused fingers), amateur, watermark, (distorted face), worst quality, jpeg artifacts, low quality, (malformed limbs), long neck, low-res, (poorly Rendered face), low resolution, low saturation, (bad composition), Images cut out at the top, left, right, bottom, (deformed body features), (poorly rendered hands)
  Snapchat
    prompt = A Snapchat photograph. [input.description], It is a selfie taken with a cellphone
    negative = [input.negative || ""]
  Instagram
    prompt = An Instagram photograph. [input.description], It is a selfie taken with a cellphone
    negative = [input.negative || ""]
  Real Photo
    prompt = Like a real photo. [input.description]
    negative = [input.negative || ""]
  Polaroid
    prompt = authentic 2000s disposable camera Polaroid instant photo, thick white border at bottom with slight chemical imperfections and light leaks, square format, grainy film texture, warm color cast, harsh direct flash illumination with strong glare and overexposed highlights on skin and fluids, soft focus edges, classic Polaroid vignetting, [input.description] Polaroid film characteristics,
    negative = [input.negative || ""]
  Luxury
    prompt = A masterpiece, best quality, ultra-realistic photography, photorealistic, hyper-detailed real human skin with natural pores, subtle imperfections, and radiant glow, raw photo, 8k, sharp focus, real human anatomy, shot on Canon EOS R5 85mm lens f/1.4, soft cinematic lighting with warm golden rim light and gentle key light from side, dramatic yet flattering shadows, [input.description] soft warm cinematic lighting with golden hour rim light, atmospheric depth of field, cinematic composition, raw ultimate sensuality, highly detailed textures on lace, skin, stockings, heels, hair, and background luxury.
    negative = [input.negative || ""]
  Pixar Character (experimental)
    prompt = A picture of [input.description], The picture is rendered in the style of the Toy Story animation franchise. 3D cartoon Pixar character portrait render. bokeh, 4k, highly detailed, Pixar render, CGI Animation, Pixar, dof, cinematic film, Pixar realism, subtle details, breathtaking Pixar short, fine details, close up, sharp focus, HDR, Pixar-style octane render, incredible composition, superb lighting and detail, \n\nOverall, it's an absolute world-class masterpiece 3D Pixar-inspired Character. It's an aesthetically pleasing 3D Pixar-inspired piece with impeccable attention to detail and impressive composition.
    negative = [input.negative || ""]
  𝗡𝗼 𝘀𝘁𝘆𝗹𝗲
    prompt = [input.description] // for "No style" we just use their prompt directly - i.e. we don't add any other text around it.
    negative = [input.negative || ""]
    meta:position = 5 // <-- this means the "No style" option will be exactly 5th in the list, regardless of tagWeights

frStyle2
  None
    prompt = [""]
    negative = [""]
    meta:position = 0
